=== case (c): weak signal recovered but costs wipe net SR ===
purged_ridge mean_CS_IC=+0.0398 (signal recovered) but net_SR=-0.383 after shared 10bps+impact costs (turn=1.338)
teach: (a) leak illusion ≠ (b) recoverable weak IC ≠ (c) IC>0 with net SR≤0 after costs

